# GAIA Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit reports completed by Softstack for GAIA and Ever Land related contracts.

GAIA is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a smart contract security reference connected to Web3 application and ecosystem infrastructure.

## Audit Information

Project: GAIA  
Audit type: Smart contract audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Reports

[02_Smart_Contract_Audit_Ever_Land.pdf](./02_Smart_Contract_Audit_Ever_Land.pdf)

[02_Smart_Contract_Audit_GAIA.pdf](./02_Smart_Contract_Audit_GAIA.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed smart contract security work across GAIA and related contract systems.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s smart contract audit work connected to Web3 application infrastructure and ecosystem smart contracts.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
